{"meta":{"id":"tt0448134","type":"movie","name":"Sunshine: Alerta solar","imdb_id":"tt0448134","description":"En un plazo de cinco años el Sol se apagará, y con él se extinguirá la raza humana. La última esperanza de los hombres es el Ícarus II, una nave espacial tripulada por seis hombres y dos mujeres, cuya misión consiste en llevar una gigantesca carga explosiva que insuflaría nueva vida a la estrella y le permitiría volver a brillar, salvándose así la población de la Tierra. El problema es que la nave Ícarus ya había llevado a cabo la misma misión siete años antes y había fracasado.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0448134.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5AIAnucJKZ3sHpm7r1ykFVIoUHK.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Ep8iAXI4Tewk4zpAnSKaXhL85G.png","genres":["Suspense","Ciencia ficción"],"releaseInfo":"2007","released":"2007-04-05T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"108 min","imdbRating":"7.2","country":"United Kingdom","cast":["Cillian Murphy","Rose Byrne","Chris Evans","Michelle Yeoh","Cliff Curtis","真田広之","Troy Garity","Benedict Wong","Mark Strong","Paloma Baeza","Archie Macdonald","Sylvie Macdonald","Chipo Chung","Kevin Hudson"],"director":["Danny Boyle"],"writer":["Alex Garland"],"trailers":[{"source":"Ig1BU6PUt0A","type":"Trailer","name":"Sunshine (2007) Original Trailer [HD]","ytId":"Ig1BU6PUt0A","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"Ig1BU6PUt0A","title":"Sunshine (2007) Original Trailer [HD]"}],"links":[{"name":"7.2","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt0448134"},{"name":"Suspense","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Suspense"},{"name":"Ciencia ficción","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Ciencia+ficci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"Cillian Murphy","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Cil